{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/entervagrientdiscordbanner.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Vagrient, an Armlys alien separated from his clan at war in another solar system. A corrupted warpgate stands between, placing a halt to his return. Power must be restored to the gate! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SOLO DEVELOPED<br>  DEBUT TITLE</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and use warpgates to travel from one planet to another</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast solar system of planets containing what Vagrient desires </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in combat with other entities whilst managing energy output and consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the unique Titan bosses, learn and strategize against there moves  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle any puzzles and obstacles that get in the way of the main objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn new skills, allowing for different movement and combat techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Extra content unlocked after game completion, utilising the Steam Leaderboards feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus lots of other exciting content to uncover and experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/sentinel1gif.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/orb_gif.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and consume a variety of these energy orbs, each having a different use case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/unstableenergyboltgif.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>NOTES FROM THE DEVELOPER:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u00a0recommend playing this game with a controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If playing with a keyboard, the arrow keys are required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game displays best at 1080p resolution (16:9 aspect ratio) however, it has been tested at\u00a02160p and it scales up well.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FULL DIVINE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/7417abef9e25871e0a95689186db43690df7f0a3.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERIOR ENERGY ORB 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/71156f6471362114806786c5c7173e5af64bc19c.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERIOR ENERGY ORB 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/71156f6471362114806786c5c7173e5af64bc19c.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERIOR ENERGY ORB 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/71156f6471362114806786c5c7173e5af64bc19c.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERIOR ENERGY ORB 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/71156f6471362114806786c5c7173e5af64bc19c.jpg"},{"name":"SUPERIOR ENERGY ORB 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/71156f6471362114806786c5c7173e5af64bc19c.jpg"},{"name":"ACTIVATED SKILL SHRINE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/ed5ac6205b0961278354b34c148fe2e6708302f0.jpg"},{"name":"ACTIVATED SKILL SHRINE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2681570/ed5ac6205b0961278354b34c148fe2e6708302f0.jpg"},{"name":"ACTIVATED SKILL SHRINE","path":"htt