><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast solar system of planets containing what Vagrient desires </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in combat with other entities whilst managing energy output and consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the unique Titan bosses, learn and strategize against there moves  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle any puzzles and obstacles that get in the way of the main objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn new skills, allowing for different movement and combat techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Extra content unlocked after game completion, utilising the Steam Leaderboards feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus lots of other exciting content to uncover and experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/sentinel1gif.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/orb_gif.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and consume a variety of these energy orbs, each having a different use case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/unstableenergyboltgif.gif?t=1743252543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>NOTES FROM THE DEVELOPER:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u00a0recommend playing this game with a controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If playing with a keyboard, the arrow keys are required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game displays best at 1080p resolution (16:9 aspect ratio) however, it has been tested at\u00a02160p and it scales up well.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Andrew \"VAGRIENT\" Bray"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descr